so-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에 대하여 의견이 있는 경우 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #ffffff single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014.01.20(</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #ffffff single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #ffffff single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></u><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">까지 교무처 또는 메일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(skpark@kumoh.ac.kr)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">로 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
